xo-ansible-inventory-manager (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release. See CHANGELOG.md for details.
  * Rewritten loader, builder and criteria engine; output now matches the
    Ansible inventory script format (_meta.hostvars).
  * Config defaults for every setting; only STORAGE_LOCATION is required.
  * Cache is opt-in, per user, permission-checked and content-invalidated.
  * Modernised packaging (debhelper 13, /usr/bin link via dh_link).

 -- XtremeOwnage <admin@xtremeownage.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0500
